From 77b6cf27cfb2acbd3c22b497f4603ed90e61754d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nishant Sharma <nishant.sharma@arm.com>
Date: Tue, 16 Apr 2024 00:00:25 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] neoverse-rd/rdv3: add crosschip pcie mappings

Add mappings in the cmn config for the remote chip PCIe root
controllers. The address are divided between 4 chips. MMIOL falls in
chip 0 default memmap range. After division, chip 0 first 64 GB address
is split and while mapping remote chip to chip 0 mappings.

Signed-off-by: Nishant Sharma <nishant.sharma@arm.com>

Signed-off-by: Jon Mason <jon.mason@arm.com>
Upstream-Status: Pending
---
 .../rdv3/scp_ramfw/config_cmn_cyprus.c        | 200 +++++++++++++++++-
 1 file changed, 192 insertions(+), 8 deletions(-)

